<title>ITALY: Ambroveneto cons net profit up in '96.</title>
<headline>Ambroveneto cons net profit up in '96.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	    190   vs    181</p>
<p>    Operating result	   801   vs    810</p>
<p>    Return on equity	8.80 pct vs 7.99 pct</p>
<p>    Net interest income    1,777   vs  1,876</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Banco Ambrosiano Veneto.  </p>
<p>Total operating income  2,903  vs  2,799</p>
<p>    Cons net equity	   2,579  vs  2,492</p>
<p>    Total deposits	   91,041  vs 79,889</p>
<p>    Total loans		27,928  vs 26,987</p>
<p>Note- Ambroveneto said the net profit was after provisions for general banking risk of 18.5 billion.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
